  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CABEI -Technical support to improve institutional transparency</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Publish What You Fund is providing support to the Central American Bank for Economic Integration (CABEI) to improve its transparency. We have signed a memorandum of understanding and embarked on the first year of a three-year process during which we will conduct a baseline assessment of transparency, provide technical advice on improving disclosure, and complete a progress assessment and report. In addition, CABEI and Publish What You Fund will host a number of public events focusing on improving transparency across a range of MDB activities</narrative>
  </description>
